{"title":"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8183d50057bda81687bc28600cb85da92400b0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d421091cbb7d524551717309079d907dd932ae56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8183d50057bda81687bc28600cb85da92400b0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />. Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35f6a3242cbd8054a994ca9a85accfd8f440340f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2 - 3 \\times 1 = 4 - 3 \\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"201\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/b/fbb4602060a7278fd5962035d2d9febdb49398c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 - 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Pro